Package: gltbnn
Type: Package
Title: Variational Bayesian Neural Networks with Global-Local Shrinkage Priors
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: person("Se Yoon", "Lee", email = "seyoonlee.stat.math@gmail.com",
    role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"))
Description: Fit Bayesian neural networks for Gaussian regression, binary
    logistic regression, and multinomial classification with global, horseshoe,
    or global-local-tail shrinkage on individual hidden weights and biases.
    The global-local-tail model learns
    a separate tail shape for each hidden layer. Variational inference yields
    draws of the regression function, predictive draws for continuous outcomes,
    and predictive class probabilities. The tail-adaptive prior builds on Lee et al. (2024)
    <doi:10.1214/24-EJS2317>.
